  array([[ 1.,  4.],
         [10., 13.]], dtype=float32)>

  Args:
    image: 4-D `Tensor` of shape `[batch, height, width, channels]` or 3-D
      `Tensor` of shape `[height, width, channels]`.
    offset_height: Vertical coordinate of the top-left corner of the bounding
